  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Private Sector Engagement in Kenya Through Research, Advocacy and Programmes</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is on a research on private sector (PS) trend analysis in strategic partner countries (SPCs), which helps provide Oxfam with good insights of the current trends of the PS work in the countries and along value chains that relates to UK -based companies The Project looks to support efforts by Oxfam Great Britain (OGB)&apos;s private sector engagement (PSE) team in developing PSE strategy paper for specific countries such as Kenya.</narrative>
  </description>
